    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-10-18T00:57:21Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Take four minutes to clear one shelf in a shared cupboard: return misplaced items, wipe the surface with a cloth you already have, and leave it orderly.</div>
    </content>
